{"shots": [{"day": 0, "loc": "Pacific Ocean", "scene": "descent", "vo": "You're diving to the bottom of the *Mariana Trench*. One kilometer down — *total darkness*."}, {"day": 0, "loc": "Depth 9,000 m", "scene": "crack", "vo": "At nine kilometers — *a bang*. The outer window cracks."}, {"day": 0, "loc": "Archive · 1960", "scene": "trieste", "vo": "This *really happened* to the Trieste, in nineteen sixty."}, {"day": 0, "loc": "Challenger Deep", "scene": "abyss", "vo": "Eleven kilometers of water above you. And *you can't get back up*."}, {"day": 1, "loc": "Challenger Deep", "scene": "planes", "vo": "The pressure is like *fifty jumbo jets*, stacked on one person."}, {"day": 1, "loc": "Challenger Deep", "scene": "cabButton", "vo": "You hit “drop ballast”… *nothing happens*."}, {"day": 1, "loc": "Challenger Deep", "scene": "hullStress", "vo": "And if the hull cracks, it implodes *in milliseconds*."}, {"day": 2, "loc": "Challenger Deep", "scene": "cabAir", "vo": "You have *sixteen hours* of air. Plus *ninety-six* in reserve."}, {"day": 2, "loc": "Challenger Deep", "scene": "cabCO2", "vo": "But it's not the lack of oxygen that kills you. It's *carbon dioxide*."}, {"day": 2, "loc": "Challenger Deep", "scene": "cabCold", "vo": "It's *seven degrees* inside."}, {"day": 2, "loc": "Challenger Deep", "scene": "sonar", "vo": "Every word takes *seven seconds* to reach the surface."}, {"day": 3, "loc": "Challenger Deep", "scene": "cabScrape", "vo": "Something is *scratching* the glass."}, {"day": 3, "loc": "Challenger Deep", "scene": "scream", "vo": "You turn on the light. The window is covered in *hundreds of amphipods*."}, {"day": 3, "loc": "Challenger Deep", "scene": "fish", "vo": "There are no fish here. They can't survive below *eight kilometers*."}, {"day": 4, "loc": "Challenger Deep", "scene": "cabHead", "vo": "Your head hurts. *The scrubber is running out*."}, {"day": 4, "loc": "Challenger Deep", "scene": "robots", "vo": "They're sending down *a robot*. There are only a few. Kaiko was lost. Nereus was crushed."}, {"day": 4, "loc": "Challenger Deep", "scene": "robotLights", "vo": "Five hours it descends… you see its lights… and *the signal is gone*."}, {"day": 5, "loc": "Challenger Deep", "scene": "magnets", "vo": "Last chance. The ballast is held by *electromagnets*."}, {"day": 5, "loc": "Challenger Deep", "scene": "cabSwitch", "vo": "Cut the power, and they let go. But the *air scrubber* dies with it."}, {"day": 5, "loc": "Challenger Deep", "scene": "cabOff", "vo": "*The switch*."}, {"day": 5, "loc": "Challenger Deep", "scene": "release", "vo": "Tons of iron shot fall away."}, {"day": 5, "loc": "Ascent", "scene": "ascent", "vo": "Three hours up, *in total darkness*…"}, {"day": 5, "loc": "Surface", "scene": "surface", "vo": "…and you *see the light*."}, {"day": 0, "loc": "", "scene": "end", "vo": "Would *you* take the risk?"}], "meta": [{"dur": 5.478229166666667, "phr": [[0, 2.573625, "You're diving to the bottom of the *Mariana Trench*."], [2.9936249999999998, 4.200270833333333, "One kilometer down —"], [4.450270833333333, 5.478229166666666, "*total darkness*."]]}, {"dur": 3.7825208333333333, "phr": [[0, 1.2070416666666666, "At nine kilometers —"], [1.4570416666666666, 2.051, "*a bang*."], [2.471, 3.7825208333333333, "The outer window cracks."]]}, {"dur": 3.056979166666667, "phr": [[0, 1.6704166666666667, "This *really happened* to the Trieste,"], [1.8704166666666666, 3.0569791666666664, "in nineteen sixty."]]}, {"dur": 3.7512916666666665, "phr": [[0, 2.0611041666666665, "Eleven kilometers of water above you."], [2.4811041666666664, 3.7512916666666665, "And *you can't get back up*."]]}, {"dur": 3.49225, "phr": [[0, 2.06175, "The pressure is like *fifty jumbo jets*,"], [2.26175, 3.4922500000000003, "stacked on one person."]]}, {"dur": 2.862979166666667, "phr": [[0, 1.3026041666666666, "You hit “drop ballast”…"], [1.8526041666666666, 2.8629791666666664, "*nothing happens*."]]}, {"dur": 2.933104166666667, "phr": [[0, 1.1215, "And if the